example_schemas:
Example: simple create_ticket param
{
  "name": "create_ticket",
  "description": "Create a support ticket",
  "params": [
    {"id": "title", "type": "string", "required": "true", "coerce": "basic", "examples": ["Login broken"]},
    {"id": "priority", "type": "enum", "options": "low,medium,high", "required": "false", "default": "medium"},
    {"id": "metadata", "type": "object", "shape": "customer_id:integer,source:string", "required": "false", "coerce": "smart"}
  ]
}

Example: nested address param with compact shape
{
  "name": "add_shipping",
  "params": [
    {"id": "recipient", "type": "object", "shape": "name:string,address.street:string,address.zip:integer", "required": "true"}
  ]
}
